    "detailed_description": "Binary. is a cybernetic stylish action game where you fight viruses with big swords and guns.<br><br>You are a freelance cracker who must dive into the net to fight the defenses and take control of the net.<br>Use stylish swordplay and gunfire to create combos and fight off viruses in spectacular fashion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086490/extras/f12a015d17e376c43734a486f0cb7730.poster.avif?t=1693918073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086490/extras/f12a015d17e376c43734a486f0cb7730.webm?t=1693918073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086490/extras/f12a015d17e376c43734a486f0cb7730.mp4?t=1693918073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>\u25a0Key Elements<br><strong>Brilliant combo action</strong>.<br>Use your stylish swordsmanship and shooting skills to create combos.<br>A real-time rating system evaluates the coolness of your combos.<br><br><strong>Various evasion actions</strong>.<br>You can withstand up to three attacks.<br>You can enjoy last-minute actions to avoid enemy bullets by using blink skills and invincibility time.<br><br><strong>Net Strategy</strong>.<br>The nets must be attacked in order from the entry point.<br>Analyze the gimmicks in the nets to reach the goal.<br><br><strong>Boss Battle</strong>.<br>In the depths of the net there is a boss that will be the final defense system.<br>Use the actions you learned along the way to defeat the boss.<br><br>\u25a0 Discord Server<br>",
    "about_the_game": "Binary. is a cybernetic stylish action game where you fight viruses with big swords and guns.<br><br>You are a freelance cracker who must dive into the net to fight the defenses and take control of the net.<br>Use stylish swordplay and gunfire to create combos and fight off viruses in spectacular fashion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086490/extras/f12a015d17e376c43734a486f0cb7730.poster.avif?t=1693918073\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086490/extras/f12a015d17e376c43734a486f0cb7730.webm?t=1693918073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086490/extras/f12a015d17e376c43734a486f0cb7730.mp4?t=1693918073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>\u25a0Key Elements<br><strong>Brilliant combo action</strong>.<br>Use your stylish swordsmanship and shooting skills to create combos.<br>A real-time rating system evaluates the coolness of your combos.<br><br><strong>Various evasion actions</strong>.<br>You can withstand up to three attacks.<br>You can enjoy last-minute actions to avoid enemy bullets by using blink skills and invincibility time.<br><br><strong>Net Strategy</strong>.<br>The nets must be attacked in order from the entry point.<br>Analyze the gimmicks in the nets to reach the goal.<br><br><strong>Boss Battle</strong>.<br>In the depths of the net there is a boss that will be the final defense system.<br>Use the actions you learned along the way to defeat the boss.<br><br>\u25a0 Discord Server<br>",
